    "64",
    "8 (1 pint) jars"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Jam / Jelly"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "American"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "American"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "3.5 pounds Concord grapes",
    "0.5 cup water",
    "7 cups white sugar",
    "1 (3 ounce) pouch liquid pectin"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HI14bR97Jyw3RV4boPwJRu_XPao=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-35158-concord-grape-jelly-DDMFS-step-1-ed9a5ccbcca7444c9b3cea6fccc9bbcd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/35158/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sort and wash grapes; discard stems. Place grapes into a large stockpot and crush them.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NU4c2H1PmGMqgM7V5dwJW_FkKqM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-35158-concord-grape-jelly-DDMFS-step-2-75854d426412486697a4aff4cb173e4b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/35158/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add water, cover, and bring to a boil over high heat. Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/h_pnQr9Oifm9rgzCvSn8cVgc0H4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-35158-concord-grape-jelly-DDMFS-step-3-fcb28c3f2e3d4d3eab7a3ae820b6376e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/35158/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from heat; pour juice into a strainer over a large bowl to extract juice. Allow juice to stand in a cool place 8 hours to overnight to prevent the formation of crystals in the jelly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yFtVd4jGAqCGl8MeyL_8cZWvVF8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-35158-concord-grape-jelly-DDMFS-step-4-30ea80fc14064277930a7701e5c1a526.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/35158/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Strain juice through a double layer of damp cheesecloth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EWncX2d4buhdnTh7914C1RM9-o0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-35158-concord-grape-jelly-DDMFS-step-5-54af95108a2a40e5b4251760021953e0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/35158/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Measure 4 cups juice into a large pot; stir in sugar and bring to a rolling boil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZMtnZxN1d3jmXYEy9eWZhABCWZ8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-35158-concord-grape-jelly-DDMFS-step-6-a8bb3de50d1a4f63b98245b5a34eb3cf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/35158/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in pectin and allow to boil for 1 minute. Remove from heat and skim off any foam on the surface.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mAEXThKN5XvR2bBTrPnYJJhh1mU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-35158-concord-grape-jelly-DDMFS-step-7-b8ca9666f1514a88aa635ef9911f958d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/35158/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pack jelly into hot, sterilized jars, filling to within 1/4 inch of the top. Run a clean knife or thin spatula around the insides of the jars to remove any air bubbles. Wipe rims with a moist paper towel to remove any residue. Top with sterile lids and screw rings on tightly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/giDSlZM2qteKe9IsukPvHS1jdlA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-35158-concord-grape-jelly-DDMFS-step-8-0b465bd5dcf54e499591c3cb35f9bd7b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/35158/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place a rack in the bottom of a large stockpot and fill halfway with water. Bring to a boil and lower jars 2 inches apart into the boiling water using a holder. Pour in more boiling water to cover jars by at least 1 inch. Bring to a rolling boil, cover, and process for 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/s8hjLqAjH7q5YZ5atgqH0ScMMzI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-35158-concord-grape-jelly-DDMFS-step-9-fe74ed993342471eb5482a53c0a2dca3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/35158/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press the center of each lid with a finger to ensure the lid does not move up or down. Remove the rings for storage and store in a cool, dark area.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MXwf80VNzELXatZHDiK8IR-veDA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-35158-concord-grape-jelly-DDMFS-step-10-573ad07c37b340ff8d4bc6bb99aa3f93.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/35158/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_bb6TePFqs5ORptkmL3n4xPLcrs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-35158-concord-grape-jelly-DDMFS-4x3-1e364328468a494b8e717dfae7f446b5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/35158/step_11.webp"
    }
  ],
